  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Our website migration SEO checklist",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"process-title\">Our website migration <span class=\"accent\">SEO checklist</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Click each stage to see what we do before, during and after launch.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs tabs--steps\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Process steps\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-41-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"tabs-41-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\"><span class=\"tabs__step-num\">01</span><span class=\"tabs__step-title\">Plan</span></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-41-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"tabs-41-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"tabs__step-num\">02</span><span class=\"tabs__step-title\">Map</span></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-41-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"tabs-41-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"tabs__step-num\">03</span><span class=\"tabs__step-title\">Test</span></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-41-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"tabs-41-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"tabs__step-num\">04</span><span class=\"tabs__step-title\">Launch</span></button>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tabs__step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tabs-41-tab-4\" aria-controls=\"tabs-41-panel-4\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"tabs__step-num\">05</span><span class=\"tabs__step-title\">Monitor</span></button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panels\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--step\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-41-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-41-tab-0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"step-time\">4–8 weeks before</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Plan</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We crawl the old site, record rankings and traffic, and agree the new URL structure.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tabs__deliv-label\">What you get</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Benchmark of rankings and traffic</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> List of every URL and its value</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> New URL structure agreed</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-card__big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>01</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--step\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-41-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-41-tab-1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"step-time\">2–4 weeks before</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Map</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every old URL is mapped to its new page, with content and metadata checked.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tabs__deliv-label\">What you get</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Redirect map</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Content and metadata checks</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Internal link updates</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-visual\"><figure class=\"mock\">\n\t<div class=\"mock__bar\"><span class=\"mock__dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mock__title\">Redirect map · 1,284 URLs</span></div>\n\t<div class=\"mock__body\"><div class=\"mock-scroll\"><table class=\"mock-table\"><thead><tr><th>Old URL</th><th>New URL</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>/services.php?id=12</td><td>/services/seo/</td><td><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">301</span></td></tr><tr><td>/blog/2019/05/seo-tips</td><td>/articles/seo-tips/</td><td><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">301</span></td></tr><tr><td>/about-us.html</td><td>/about/</td><td><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">301</span></td></tr><tr><td>/old-landing</td><td>/services/</td><td><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">301</span></td></tr><tr><td>/products/item-445</td><td>/shop/linen-shirt/</td><td><span class=\"mock-chip mock-chip--ok\">301</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</figure></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--step\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-41-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-41-tab-2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"step-time\">1–2 weeks before</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Test</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We test the new site on staging: redirects, indexing, speed, structured data and tracking.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tabs__deliv-label\">What you get</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Staging crawl report</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Redirect test results</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Tracking checks</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-card__big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>03</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--step\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-41-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-41-tab-3\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"step-time\">Launch day</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Launch</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We check redirects, robots rules, sitemaps and Search Console the moment the site goes live.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tabs__deliv-label\">What you get</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Launch checklist signed off</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> New sitemaps submitted</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Change of address if needed</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-card__big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>04</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel tabs__panel--step\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tabs-41-panel-4\" aria-labelledby=\"tabs-41-tab-4\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tabs__panel-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"step-time\">4–8 weeks after</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"tabs__panel-title\">Monitor</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Daily checks on errors, indexing and rankings, with fixes made straight away.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tabs__deliv-label\">What you get</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"tick-list tick-list--plain\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Daily error checks</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Weekly ranking reports</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Final migration report</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"step-card__big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>05</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "seo-migration",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
